# oracle: w298neb_fire_climb_ebf — the NEB of w296neb_fire_abc printed every iteration: in the climbing stage EBF, EBR and GradVc are the climbing replica's even on steps where another replica is higher (neb.cpp print_status: irep = fneb->rclimber)
# oracle-partitions: 3
# oracle-inputs: w46neb_tiny.final
# oracle-compare: rel=1e-5 abs=1e-6
# Measured max relative error, engine vs native (NEB table, printed with 8 significant digits): 3.9e-8.
dimension 2
boundary p s p
units lj
atom_style atomic
atom_modify map array
region box block 0 6 0 6 -0.5 0.5
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 single 1.5 1.5 0
create_atoms 1 single 3.0 1.7 0
create_atoms 1 single 4.5 1.5 0
mass 1 1.0
pair_style lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff * * 1.0 1.0 2.5
pair_modify shift yes
variable u uloop 3
fix 1 all enforce2d
fix 2 all neb 1.0 parallel ideal
timestep 0.05
thermo 10
min_style fire
min_modify alpha0 0.10 integrator verlet abcfire yes
neb 0.0 0.01 40 40 1 final w46neb_tiny.final
